{"suttaId":"tha-ap252","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8231,8248],"vripara":"34"},"segments":{"tha-ap252:0.3":"Uddālakadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap252:1.1":"“Kakudho nāma nāmena, sayambhū aparājito;","tha-ap252:1.3":"Pavanā nikkhamitvāna, anuppatto mahānadiṃ.","tha-ap252:2.1":"“Uddālakaṃ gahetvāna, sayambhussa adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap252:2.3":"Saṃyatassujubhūtassa, pasannamānaso ahaṃ.","tha-ap252:3.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap252:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pupphadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap252:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap252:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā uddālakadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap252:6.1":"Uddālakadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap252:7.1":"Tuvaradāyakavaggo pañcavīsatimo.","tha-ap252:8.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap252:9.1":"Tuvaranāganaḷinā, viravī kuṭidhūpako;","tha-ap252:9.3":"Patto dhātusattaliyo, bimbi uddālakena ca;","tha-ap252:9.5":"Sattatiṃsati gāthāyo, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhi."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3206,"to":3206,"paras":[{"para":3206,"vripara":"35","refs":["tha-ap252:2"],"lines":["Dasamāpadāne <b>uddālakaṃ gahetvānā</b>ti jātassare vihaṅgasobbhe jātaṃ uddālakapupphaṃ ocinitvā kakusandhassa bhagavato pūjesinti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap252:2"],["tha-ap252:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap252:2.1","uddālakaṃ gahetvānā",0,0]]},"tika":null}
